  "strategy": "Bello, Bard of the Brambles turns every non-Equipment artifact and non-Aura enchantment you control with mana value 4 or greater into a hasty, indestructible 4/4 Elemental on your turn, each drawing a card when it connects. Sol Ring, the Signets and Talismans, Thran Dynamo, Gilded Lotus, Hedron Archive, Cultivate, Farseek and Sakura-Tribe Elder ramp toward those permanents, and Alchemist's Talent, Big Score, Bootlegger's Stash and Rain of Riches add Treasure on the way. Spine of Ish Sah, Esika's Chariot, Rolling Hamsphere, Primeval Bounty, Outpost Siege, Warstorm Surge, Gratuitous Violence and Berserkers' Onslaught are the army Bello wakes up, and the last two make its swings hit twice as hard. Teapot Slinger, Wandertale Mentor, Pyreswipe Hawk and Trailtracker Scout pay off a turn of big spells through expend, while Etali, Wildsear and Sunbird's Invocation turn one spell into two. Beast Within, Chaos Warp, Decimate, Abrade and Starstorm answer what matters, and Blasphemous Act resets a board the indestructible army survives.",
